{"id": "69854", "title": "燃烧你的奇迹", "author": "蒹葭采采", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69854.htm", "intro": "风雨过后彩虹现，云开雾散明月见……齐迹挠头，\r\n好歹念了一年半大学，咋就凑不上个七言绝句呢！\r\n呆头……本想写首小诗跟某人显摆显摆，可惜……又夭折了！\r\n难不成我真的要做一辈子煮饭婆？可俺是汉子啊汉子…… \r\n声明：此文耽美向，多以感情线为主，但略带感官刺激~~~~~~", "base": "files/article/html/69/69854", "chapters": [{"title": "1-6", "file": "10711404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7-12", "file": "10711405.html", "available": true}, {"title": "13-19", "file": "10711406.html", "available": true}, {"title": "20-25", "file": "10711407.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-31", "file": "10711408.html", "available": true}, {"title": "32-38", "file": "10711409.html", "available": true}, {"title": "39-45", "file": "10711410.html", "available": true}, {"title": "46-51", "file": "10711411.html", "available": true}, {"title": "52-58", "file": "10711412.html", "available": true}, {"title": "59-64", "file": "10711413.html", "available": true}, {"title": "65-70", "file": "10711414.html", "available": true}, {"title": "71-76", "file": "10711415.html", "available": true}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10711416.html", "available": true}]}